Indirect compute dispatch does not depend on indirect draws

Encoder::dispatch with an indirect buffer asserted BGFX_CAPS_DRAW_INDIRECT. Vulkan reports that cap
only with multiDrawIndirect and drawIndirectFirstInstance, which many mobile GPUs lack (Mali-G78),
although vkCmdDispatchIndirect is core Vulkan. Debug builds stopped at the first indirect dispatch on
those GPUs. The compute check that follows is the one that applies.

diff --git a/src/bgfx.cpp b/src/bgfx.cpp
--- a/src/bgfx.cpp
+++ b/src/bgfx.cpp
@@ -5222,7 +5222,6 @@ namespace bgfx
 
 	void Encoder::dispatch(ViewId _id, ProgramHandle _program, IndirectBufferHandle _indirectHandle, uint32_t _start, uint32_t _num, uint8_t _flags)
 	{
-		BGFX_CHECK_CAPS(BGFX_CAPS_DRAW_INDIRECT, "Dispatch indirect is not supported!");
 		BGFX_CHECK_CAPS(BGFX_CAPS_COMPUTE, "Compute is not supported!");
 		BGFX_CHECK_HANDLE_INVALID_OK("dispatch", s_ctx->m_programHandle, _program);
 		BGFX_CHECK_HANDLE("dispatch", s_ctx->m_vertexBufferHandle, _indirectHandle);
